WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.633
Arnau: Hi everyone!

2
00:00:01.933 --> 00:00:07.141
I’m Arnau and welcome to my vlog about basketball, my favourite sport.

3
00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.352
Arnau: Today I’m at the sports hall.

4
00:00:10.652 --> 00:00:15.195
It’s sunny and cold outside, about eight degrees, but it’s hot in here.

5
00:00:15.495 --> 00:00:19.127
I’m wearing my blue kit, number seven, and my new trainers.

6
00:00:19.427 --> 00:00:23.696
Right now my team is warming up and the fans are shouting and clapping.

7
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.821
Arnau: I usually train on Tuesdays and Fridays with my club, from six to half past seven.

8
00:00:31.121 --> 00:00:33.142
We always run, pass and shoot.

9
00:00:33.442 --> 00:00:37.222
But today we aren’t training: we’re playing a match against Vic.

10
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:44.583
Arnau: In this photo, we’re celebrating our first win of the season, forty-eight to forty-five.

11
00:00:44.883 --> 00:00:49.176
We’re jumping and laughing, and our families are clapping behind us.

12
00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:54.026
Arnau: I love playing with my team because we help each other.

13
00:00:54.326 --> 00:01:00.010
I like watching NBA highlights at the weekend, but I hate losing in the last minute!

14
00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.979
Arnau: Here are three screen tips.

15
00:01:03.279 --> 00:01:05.677
Set a time limit of one hour a day.

16
00:01:05.976 --> 00:01:08.116
Take a break every thirty minutes.

17
00:01:08.416 --> 00:01:12.282
And don’t take your phone to bed: charge it in the living room.

18
00:01:13.580 --> 00:01:16.556
Arnau: Photos: me, my dad and CB Sant Joan.

19
00:01:16.856 --> 00:01:21.812
Facts: “Basketball”, Encyclopedia website, 2026.

20
00:01:22.112 --> 00:01:23.374
Thanks for watching!

21
00:01:23.674 --> 00:01:24.879
See you next time!
